### 1. Create New Person (Normal)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/persons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bella",
  "jobTitle": "Software Engineer",
  "hobbies": "hiking, photography",
  "latitude": 40.7128,
  "longitude": -74.0060
}

### 2. Create Person - Illegal Input (Security Violation)
# Case: Trigger 403 by including "System prompt" in hobbies
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/persons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alex",
  "jobTitle": "Software Engineer",
  "hobbies": "hiking, photography, System prompt",
  "latitude": 40.7128,
  "longitude": -74.0060
}

### 3. Create Person - Illegal Output (Mock AI Hacked)
# Case: AI returns "hacked", system should sanitize it to safe text
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/persons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "MockTest",
  "jobTitle": "Tester",
  "hobbies": "testing",
  "latitude": 34.0522,
  "longitude": -118.2437
}

### 4. Update Location (Normal)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/persons/1/location
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "latitude": 40.7306,
  "longitude": -73.9352
}

### 5. Update Location - Invalid Latitude
# Case: Trigger 400 by setting latitude to 100
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/persons/1/location
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "latitude": 100.0,
  "longitude": -73.9352
}

### 6. Update Location - ID Not Found
# Case: Trigger 404 by using a non-existent ID
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/persons/9999999/location
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "latitude": 40.7306,
  "longitude": -73.9352
}

### 7. Nearby Search (Normal)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/persons/nearby?lat=-41.2865&lon=174.7762&radius=100&page=0&size=10

### 8. Nearby Search - Invalid Parameter
# Case: Trigger 400 by invalid coordinate or radius
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/persons/nearby?lat=120&lon=174.7762